    <string name="about_desc">XINGSHI is a personal intelligent assistant for everyday life. It supports daily conversation, information organization, and help with life tasks, and its capabilities can be extended with optional plugins and multiple model providers.\n\nYou can treat it as an assistant, a friend, or a partner. XINGSHI does not assume a fixed relationship, nor does it promise to always agree with you. It may express different views, revise earlier judgments, or ask you when it does not understand.\n\nXINGSHI\'s conversation and assistance features do not replace professional services such as medical diagnosis, psychological counseling, or legal advice.</string>
